
 swarm-lab node  -  this container is your "VM". Its dockerd is a swarm node.
 Scenario files: /lab/scenarios   (stack name: app)

 Swarm:   docker node ls | docker service ls | docker service ps --no-trunc app_<svc>
          docker service logs app_<svc> | docker inspect <container>
 Net:     ip -br a | ip route | ss -tulpn | tcpdump -ni eth0 | iptables-save | tc qdisc show
          nsenter -n -t <pid> ...  (enter a container's netns: pid = docker inspect -f '{{.State.Pid}}')
 System:  df -h | df -i | free -m | dmesg -T | lsof | /sys/fs/cgroup | journal = docker logs on host

